| ✓ 2. scope (completed)
|     - Define the scope of work.
| ○ 3. design (skipped)
|     - Produce a technical design.
|     - Manually produced: <...>/add-feature/artifacts/design.md
| ▶ 4. decompose (current)
|     - Break work into tasks.
|   5. implement
|     - Write the implementation.
